  "type": "human-bridge",
  "outputProtocol": "human-bridge",
  "riskLevel": "workspace-write",
  "capabilityTags": ["write", "refactor", "design", "analyze"],
  "command": null,
  "args": [],
  "env": {},
  "healthCheck": null,
  "sessionMode": false,
  "interruptMethod": null,
  "timeoutDefault": 600000,
  "timeoutMax": 1800000,
  "maxRetries": 0,
  "notes": "GUI 型 Agent，无 CLI 入口。workbench 生成 briefing 后复制到剪贴板，人工在 Trae SOLO 执行后粘贴回执。产出由人工回填，总线事件标记 meta.via='human-bridge' + meta.untrusted=true。",
  "bridgeInstructions": {
    "prompt": "请将以下任务在 Trae SOLO 中完成，并把产出（文件变更清单、diff、测试结果）粘贴回工作台。",
